	(descr "Hirose U.FL-R-SMT-1(10) vertical coaxial receptacle. Manufacturer's recommended land pattern, via the KiCad Connector_Coaxial library, which cites https://www.hirose.com/product/en/products/U.FL/U.FL-R-SMT-1%2810%29/ . Signal pad 1.05 x 1.0 mm, two ground pads 2.2 x 1.05 mm. The signal pad is 1.0 mm across, so a 50 ohm line on 1.6 mm FR4 (2.95 mm) must taper into it, not butt onto it."
